  "id": "humanity",
  "term": "humanity",
  "definition": "Humanity here means an ideal human potential that each person already carries and can awaken, especially through artistic experience and self-cultivation. It is described as developing through awareness of the mind, emotion, and self, and as moving toward ways of being that express the self, rise beyond self-limits, or even let go of the self altogether.",
